{"id":"669ee474b9646a38","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-VF.md","title":"Cantini 的超赋值真理理论 VF","display":"df-VF — Cantini 的超赋值真理理论 VF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-VF","aliases":["91-df-VF","91-df-cantini-VF"],"display":"df-VF — Cantini 的超赋值真理理论 VF","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]","[[91-df-classical-extension]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-VF"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-VF</span><span>91-df-cantini-VF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-VF — Cantini 的超赋值真理理论 VF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bde974325ff73b34\" href=\"?note=bde974325ff73b34\" title=\"91-df-classical-extension\">91-df-classical-extension</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。闭项量词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{TrNum}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{TrNum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}\\)</span> 是自然表示的 PA<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_T\">\\(_T\\)</span> 公理编码谓词。</li>\n<li>固定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sf}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}_z(\\ulcorner D(z)\\urcorner,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{sf}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}_z(\\ulcorner D(z)\\urcorner,a)\\)</span> 是句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(\\overline a)\">\\(D(\\overline a)\\)</span> 的编码，不是句子编码谓词本身。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_1,\\ldots,V_8\">\\(V_1,\\ldots,V_8\\)</span> 是下述对象句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_9\">\\(V_9\\)</span> 是公式模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 是所定义的公理集及其闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}VF}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nV_1:\\;&amp;\\forall s\\forall t\\,[(T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t))\\land\n(T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t))];\\\\\nV_2:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(a)\\to T(a));\\\\\nV_3:\\;&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))\\to T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a)))];\\\\\nV_4:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,(T(a)\\to T(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)));\\\\\nV_5:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)))\\to T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))];\\\\\nV_6:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(a)\\to T(b)))];\\\\\nV_7:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{conj}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a),\\operatorname{TrNum}(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))));\\\\\nV_8:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,T(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a),\\operatorname{sf}(a))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}VF}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nV_1:\\;&amp;\\forall s\\forall t\\,[(T(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t))\\land\n(T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)))\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(s)\\ne\\operatorname{val}(t))];\\\\\nV_2:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T}(a)\\to T(a));\\\\\nV_3:\\;&amp;\\forall v\\forall a\\,[D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\to(\\forall t\\,T(\\operatorname{SubTm}(a,t,v))\\to T(\\operatorname{all}(v,a)))];\\\\\nV_4:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,(T(a)\\to T(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)));\\\\\nV_5:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,[D(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)))\\to T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))];\\\\\nV_6:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\forall b\\,[D(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(a)\\to T(b)))];\\\\\nV_7:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,T(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{conj}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a),\\operatorname{TrNum}(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))));\\\\\nV_8:\\;&amp;\\forall a\\,T(\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a),\\operatorname{sf}(a))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_9\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{\\vec x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_9\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,[T(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\\to\\varphi(\\vec x)]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{\\vec x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\coloneqq\\{V_1,\\ldots,V_8\\}\\cup V_9,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{VF}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}\\coloneqq\\{V_1,\\ldots,V_8\\}\\cup V_9,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{VF}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{VF}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>VF 的名称与 van Fraassen 的超赋值路线相关，旧解作 Verum Falsum 无来源，已删除。原书 第 18 章 给出性质与强度概述，没有完整列出这九组公理；精确列表另以 Cantini 理论的研究文献核对，故此处明确补充来源。\n旧定义的内部一致性只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner T(a)\\to\\neg T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner T(a)\\to\\neg T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\urcorner)\\)</span>；正确 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_7\">\\(V_7\\)</span> 无条件断言内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))\">\\(\\neg(T(a)\\land T(\\operatorname{neg}(a)))\\)</span> 为真。在缺乏全组合公理的 VF 中，不可把这两种内引号句直接视为等价。\n真理原子编码必须先造数码：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)=\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{num}(a))\">\\(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)=\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{num}(a))\\)</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{tr}(a)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_9\">\\(V_9\\)</span> 是统一 T-out，而非允许从带假设证明中无条件捕获的规则。\n上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_1,V_3\">\\(V_1,V_3\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 量词按共享编码约定遍历闭项代码，\n不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_3\">\\(V_3\\)</span> 的替换项改成遍历任意数字代码、又不添加闭项守卫。\n本表显式写出了量词及蕴涵句子的句法域守卫：由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_8\">\\(V_8\\)</span> 和\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_9\">\\(V_9\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(z)=T(z)\\to D(z)\">\\(\\varphi(z)=T(z)\\to D(z)\\)</span> 实例，VF 已证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\">\\(\\forall a(T(a)\\to D(a))\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_6\">\\(V_6\\)</span> 的守卫可由其真理前提推出。\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_3\">\\(V_3\\)</span>，PA 的句法检查给出：固定任一闭项（如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>）的替换结果\n若为句子，则被全称封闭的矩阵也是句子。因此其全部闭项实例\n为真的前提已推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\">\\(D(\\operatorname{all}(v,a))\\)</span>，加入该守卫不改变结论。\nVF 是经典对象理论，意向模型来自 VC 超赋值固定点；它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 有相同算术后果，不能写成与 KF 等强。它也不含一般析取组合双条件。</p>\n<p>来源：第 18 章，印刷页 251–252，PDF 页 262–263；补充：\nDopico–Hayashi，Axiomatic theories of supervaluational truth: completing the picture（2024），Definition 1、Propositions 1–2（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.12471v1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.12471v1</a>）；\n闭项量化约定另参 Stern（2018）§3、§6 的记号与量词原则（<a href=\"https://johannesstern.github.io/publication/stern-2018-superval/sv.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://johannesstern.github.io/publication/stern-2018-superval/sv.pdf</a>）。\n此处只使用这些通行公理与编码约定，不依赖该文有关其他超赋值式算子的模型刻画。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertio